WEBVTT

00:10:58.946 --> 00:11:00.197
to meet the moment.

00:11:00.572 --> 00:11:05.536
We want and need national governments
and international organizations

00:11:05.577 --> 00:11:08.872
to work with us, to back us,
to support us.

00:11:08.872 --> 00:11:10.749
But we cannot wait for them.

00:11:11.083 --> 00:11:13.085
The world's top scientists tell us

00:11:13.127 --> 00:11:16.171
we've got ten years
to turn this thing around.

00:11:16.755 --> 00:11:21.385
And because of a history of inaction,
underperformance,

00:11:21.427 --> 00:11:23.512
turgidness in decision making,

00:11:23.512 --> 00:11:27.683
that means that right now
we need to make some big bets

00:11:27.725 --> 00:11:30.853
and we need to make
some big bets on interventions